cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KANIT, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "KANIT: an evidence-graded knowledge base of antimicrobial resistance biomarkers in the ESKAPEE pathogens"
abstract: >-
  KANIT is a knowledge base of genomic biomarkers associated with antimicrobial
  resistance in the ESKAPEE pathogens. The biomarkers are unitigs that
  gradient-boosted models select under lineage-aware cross-validation. Each
  biomarker is examined by independent lines of evidence, which a fixed rule
  combines into one evidence grade.
type: software
authors:
